---
---

<section
  id="tui-about"
  class="w-full font-mono text-[11px] sm:text-xs select-none leading-relaxed"
>
  <div class="w-full flex flex-col font-mono">
    {/* Section Header: > ABOUT ─── */}
    <div class="w-full flex items-center overflow-hidden mb-2">
      <span class="text-[var(--color-accent)] font-semibold shrink-0">
        &gt;&nbsp;
      </span>
      <span class="font-bold tracking-wider text-rp-text uppercase shrink-0">
        ABOUT
      </span>
      <span class="ml-2 flex-1 border-b border-rp-muted/20"></span>
    </div>

    {/* Section comment */}
    <div class="text-[11px] text-rp-muted/70 pl-3">
      <span>// bio</span>
    </div>

    {/* Bio Content */}
    <div class="pl-3 py-1 text-rp-subtle leading-relaxed select-text">
      <p>
        An engineer by choice. It bugs me how slow and messy most software is,
        so I build things the way they should work: fast, without the bloat, and
        knowing what's actually going on underneath. Some weeks that's a storage
        engine or SIMD search, other times a Sanskrit parser, a weird tool, or a
        full product I wanted for myself. I don't stick to one lane; I just
        figure out how the engine works and ship.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Links */}
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 pl-3 pt-2 text-rp-subtle select-none">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/adityamotale"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors underline decoration-dotted decoration-rp-muted/50 underline-offset-3"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rp-muted shrink-0 select-none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>github</span>
      </a>

      <span class="text-rp-muted/30 select-none">/</span>

      <a
        href="https://x.com/arctic_byte"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors underline decoration-dotted decoration-rp-muted/50 underline-offset-3"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rp-muted shrink-0 select-none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="currentColor"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>twitter</span>
      </a>

      <span class="text-rp-muted/30 select-none">/</span>

      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aditya-motale"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors underline decoration-dotted decoration-rp-muted/50 underline-offset-3"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rp-muted shrink-0 select-none"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"></path>
          <rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"></rect>
          <circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"></circle>
        </svg>
        <span>linkedin</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
